    "Los clientes deben reportar una disputa de factura dentro de 30 días.": "Customers must report an invoice dispute within 30 days.",
    "Reapertura del muelle": "Dock reopening",
    "El muelle 4 reabrió el 14 de mayo después de las reparaciones.": "Dock 4 reopened on May 14 after repairs were completed.",
